[
 {
  "_id": "6ab0447f7ae094adc4c6c3b0",
  "date": "2026-09-20T20:39:27.884Z",
  "u": 1789936767884,
  "name": "Anonymous",
  "country": null,
  "board": "v",
  "tripcode": null,
  "capcode": null,
  "subject": "1.12.2 Minecraft Server",
  "message": "<span class=\"greentext\">&gt;What is this?</span>\nThis is an offline 1.7.10 minecraft server running a custom mod pack.\n<span class=\"greentext\">&gt;What's in it?</span>\nthaumcraft, srp, immersive engineering, witchery, touhou little maid mod, etc.\n<span class=\"greentext\">&gt;Am I going to get raped by parasites</span>\nThe goal is to not get raped by parasites, but I can't stop you from asking for it. I've edited a lot of configs to hopefully make them tolerable <span class=\"spoiler\">Why do they do true damage by default?</span>, and we have 20 real life days(With potentially more depending on how the server pause works) to prepare before they crash into our world.\n<span class=\"greentext\">&gt;Can my toaster run this?</span>\nIt should be able to. We're using cleanroom which is just a more optimized version of forge.\n<span class=\"greentext\">&gt;What if I want \"x\" mod?</span>\nUnfortunately because of how some of the mods work it's difficult adding anything to the pack without breaking things.\n<span class=\"greentext\">&gt;What's this groovy folder?</span>\nIt's just aspect lists so thaumcraft can actually interact with most of the new blocks/items.\n<span class=\"greentext\">&gt;Why isn't distant horizons working very well</span>\nCurrently distant horizons crashes the server, so I've had to turn it off. Once this is fixed I'll add it again.\n\n<span class=\"title\">STEP BY STEP GUIDE:</span>\n<span class=\"greentext\">&gt;1.) Get whatever version of this works for you from here: <a rel=\"nofollow\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://pollymc.com/\">https://pollymc.com/</a></span>\n<span class=\"greentext\">&gt;2.) Make sure you have the latest java version, link PollyMC to it in global settings(should be able to auto detect, if not good luck)</span>\n<span class=\"greentext\">&gt;3.) Grab cleanroom zip file instance frrom <a rel=\"nofollow\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/CleanroomMC/Cleanroom/releases\">https://github.com/CleanroomMC/Cleanroom/releases</a></span>\n<span class=\"greentext\">&gt;4.) Make instance by importing from cleanroom for 1.12.2</span>\n<span class=\"greentext\">&gt;4.5) under instance settings page, versions tab click \"download all\" at the bottom right</span>\n<span class=\"greentext\">&gt;4.6) Restart PollyMC</span>\n<span class=\"greentext\">&gt;5.) Get source zip (press green code button then download zip) from <a rel=\"nofollow\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/xxXCuriositykilledthecatXxx/Sleepy-Modpack/tree/1.12.2\">https://github.com/xxXCuriositykilledthecatXxx/Sleepy-Modpack/tree/1.12.2</a> and open it</span>\n<span class=\"greentext\">&gt;6.) Put the contents of the modpack zip in your instance's .minecraft folder</span>\n<span class=\"greentext\">&gt;7.) Get scape and run parasites from curseforge, can do it via client, and add it to the mods. <a rel=\"nofollow\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scape-and-run-parasites/files/8787918\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scape-and-run-parasites/files/8787918</a></span>\n<span class=\"greentext\">&gt;8.) Run and join</span>\n<span class=\"greentext\">&gt;9.) Restart PollyMC again if it fails to launch</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"title\">Server IP:</span> 185.83.155.21:25591",
  "messagehash": "eVpqcPItgZq60ppnca0ud1Ny4y6rXvCnVP3DkiRa6C4=",
  "nomarkup": ">What is this?\nThis is an offline 1.7.10 minecraft server running a custom mod pack.\n>What's in it?\nthaumcraft, srp, immersive engineering, witchery, touhou little maid mod, etc.\n>Am I going to get raped by parasites\nThe goal is to not get raped by parasites, but I can't stop you from asking for it. I've edited a lot of configs to hopefully make them tolerable **Why do they do true damage by default?**, and we have 20 real life days(With potentially more depending on how the server pause works) to prepare before they crash into our world.\n>Can my toaster run this?\nIt should be able to. We're using cleanroom which is just a more optimized version of forge.\n>What if I want \"x\" mod?\nUnfortunately because of how some of the mods work it's difficult adding anything to the pack without breaking things.\n>What's this groovy folder?\nIt's just aspect lists so thaumcraft can actually interact with most of the new blocks/items.\n>Why isn't distant horizons working very well\nCurrently distant horizons crashes the server, so I've had to turn it off. Once this is fixed I'll add it again.\n\n==STEP BY STEP GUIDE:==\n>1.) Get whatever version of this works for you from here: https://pollymc.com/\n>2.) Make sure you have the latest java version, link PollyMC to it in global settings(should be able to auto detect, if not good luck)\n>3.) Grab cleanroom zip file instance frrom https://github.com/CleanroomMC/Cleanroom/releases\n>4.) Make instance by importing from cleanroom for 1.12.2\n>4.5) under instance settings page, versions tab click \"download all\" at the bottom right\n>4.6) Restart PollyMC\n>5.) Get source zip (press green code button then download zip) from https://github.com/xxXCuriositykilledthecatXxx/Sleepy-Modpack/tree/1.12.2 and open it\n>6.) Put the contents of the modpack zip in your instance's .minecraft folder\n>7.) Get scape and run parasites from curseforge, can do it via client, and add it to the mods. https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scape-and-run-parasites/files/8787918\n>8.) Run and join\n>9.) Restart PollyMC again if it fails to launch\n\n\n==Server IP:== 185.83.155.21:25591",
